REM Test payload for Latin American (LATAM) keyboard layout
REM This firmware build has no literal "LATAM" locale - win_es-MX is the
REM closest match used by this Ducky lib for Spanish Latin American layouts.
REM Requires platformio.ini -> [keyboardlayouts] -D LOCALE_win_es_MX (already enabled)

KEYBOARD_LAYOUT win_es-MX

DELAY 1000
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 1000
STRING Probando layout LATAM: ñ Ñ á é í ó ú ¿? ¡! @ " ' / \
ENTER
